      },
      "message": "fix(post): enforce compensation plane safety and refuse unsupported G74 on Tormach mill\n\nResolve reviewer findings for Tormach mill post:\n- Restore G17 before cutter compensation engagement or cancel in assets/posts/tormach.cps.\n- Refuse non-XY arcs while compensation is active.\n- Refuse left-hand rigid tapping (G74) by name per PathPilot guidelines.\n- Add Tormach to crates/post/tests/comp_plane.rs and crates/post/tests/comp.rs.\n- Update crates/app/tests/wear_comp.rs to verify wear compensation on Tormach.\n- Update decision record docs/decisions/4228-tormach-g54-1-p-m4-g74.md.\n\nRefs #4299\nFixes #4228",
